Font,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">KRAFTON 发布开源模型 Raon-1 mini，采用 MoE 架构对标 Meta 同档模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布Claude桌面端全新界面，由AI深度参与设计并于3周内上线</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Reddit开源子版块r/opensource颁布AI禁令，全面封杀人工智能相关项目</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/167dab2df750b0cf174b974f5c6caccb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Reddit社区r/opensource子版块版主Wolvereness于2026年10月25日宣布实施重大规则调整，全面禁止在该子版块发布任何涉及人工智能及AI生成内容的项目。新规明确，任何使用、制造或旨在供AI使用的开源项目均被禁止，包括包含AI贡献的代码或人工编写的模型上下文协议（MCP）。此举引发行业广泛争议，批评者指出，该禁令将Linux内核等已引入Claude Code等AI辅助编程工具的主流开源项目排除在外。受此影响，部分开发者已创建支持AI的r/TrueOpenSource子版块。该事件反映了开源社区在代码溯源、版权归属及社区治理理念上的深层分歧，或将重塑开源生态的技术边界与治理规则。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Kimi就K3.1 Pro限流及额度异常致歉，向全体订阅会员补偿25%额度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">10月26日，Kimi智能助手针对近期K3.1 Pro模型使用体验不佳发布致歉信。此前，月之暗面于10月24日正式发布K3.1 Pro模型，该模型具备3万亿级参数及100万上下文处理能力，上线后因用户集中涌入导致高峰期响应限流及额度异常消耗。针对上述问题，官方承诺在10月26日内为所有有效期内的订阅会员统一补发月度总额25%的额度，若已消耗额度未达25%则直接清零进度条，无需用户申请。此外，Kimi已着手优化后端配置，通过压减不必要的子Agent调用及精简冗长输出，提升额度使用效率。此次事件反映出AI应用在模型能力升级的同时，服务端稳定性与计费透明度仍是影响用户体验的关键挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">KRAFTON 发布开源模型 Raon-1 mini，采用 MoE 架构对标 Meta 同档模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7c1bc6b6934d8f44c44ae83dd663d283.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">韩国游戏巨头 KRAFTON 旗下 KRAFTON AI 正式发布 Raon-1 mini 模型预览版。该模型采用混合专家（MoE）架构，总参数量为 30B，单次激活参数为 4B，支持线性注意力机制与推测解码技术。Raon-1 mini 针对韩语与英语进行优化，以 Apache 2.0 协议开源，并提供限时免费 API 试用。官方测试显示，该模型在编程与智能体任务表现上与 Meta 的 Muse Glimmer 30B 相当，但在推理速度与内存占用上更具优势。KRAFTON 此举旨在通过自研底座满足游戏开发中 NPC 对话、剧情生成及代码辅助等高频需求，同时通过开源策略构建开发者生态。该模型切入 30B 这一易于本地部署的体量段，为寻求高性能且可控性强的开发者提供了替代方案。后续 KRAFTON 将持续推进正式</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude桌面端全新界面，由AI深度参与设计并于3周内上线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日正式推出Claude桌面端应用的全新界面，该版本由Claude自身深度参与设计，从构思草图到正式上线仅耗时不到3周。此次改版引入了全新的UI布局与侧边栏功能，展示了LLM在产品设计与工程落地中的高效能。然而，新界面在用户侧引发了争议，部分用户反馈新版信息密度较低，且摒弃了标志性的衬线字体与暖色调背景，整体视觉风格偏向冷峻，与同类产品趋同，对项目面板的可读性造成了一定影响。尽管存在设计争议，但此次更新作为人机协同开发软件界面的创新实践，为AI在产品设计领域的应用提供了重要的行业参考案例。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
